      <item>
        <title>Game of Life Dev Log: Rules and Diagnostics</title>
        <description>&lt;p&gt;I refined rule toggles and tightened diagnostics visibility for births, deaths, and live cell counts.
&lt;!--description--&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This update was about confidence and observability. I validated behavior around rule toggles and made sure the diagnostic readouts track simulation changes clearly while stepping or running continuously.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
