      <item>
        <title>Game of Life Dev Log: Shareable URL State</title>
        <description>&lt;p&gt;I added another pass on URL state sharing so board setups are easier to copy and reopen.
&lt;!--description--&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The focus here was reliability around encoding and decoding current grid state. I tested copy/paste workflows to ensure links are stable enough for iterative debugging and sharing specific simulation snapshots.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
