      <item>
        <title>Game of Life Dev Log: Pattern Workflow Improvements</title>
        <description>&lt;p&gt;I improved pattern loading and made it easier to move from preset exploration into custom edits.
&lt;!--description--&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This pass tightened the interaction model around pattern input and board resets. The goal was to make experimentation feel lightweight: pick a preset, tweak a few cells, and continue simulating without losing flow.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
