      <item>
        <title>I now work at Microsoft</title>
        <description>&lt;p&gt;I now work at Microsoft where I am continuing as a Senior Software Engineering Manager, following it’s acquisition of Xandr, Inc from AT&amp;amp;T&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;!--description--&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The acquistion was earlier announced in December 2021 after I had just started paternity leave.  I am very excited at the outcome for me and my colleagues at Xandr following what seemed like a misadventure for several years at AT&amp;amp;T.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-lightbox=&quot;lightbox1&quot; href=&quot;/assets/img/posts/2022/jun/microsoft/logo-monochrome.svg&quot;&gt;
